WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.684
Python can assign several values to several
variables in one statement The values

00:00:05.711 --> 00:00:11.223
are matched to the variable names by position For
example a name

00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:16.357
an age and a salary can be assigned in one line This
can be convenient

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:21.916
when the relationship is obvious and the line
remains easy to read The main

00:00:21.942 --> 00:00:27.760
caution is that order matters If the values are
rearranged without rearranging the variable

00:00:27.787 --> 00:00:32.945
names the program may still run but the meaning will
be wrong Concise code is

00:00:32.971 --> 00:00:37.260
useful but readable and correct code is more
important than using fewer lines
